# All ignored files needed in Linux/
# Uncomment files in Linux/NixOS/hosts/NixOS/default.nix to use them
#
# Nix modules (create from repo history or manually):
#   - Linux/NixOS/packages/ida-pro.nix
#   - Linux/NixOS/packages/ida-mcp.nix
#   - Linux/NixOS/packages/ida-plugins.nix
#
# Setup after nixos-rebuild switch:
#   1. nix-store --add-fixed sha256 Linux/ida-pro_93_x64linux.run
#   2. sudo nixos-rebuild switch --flake /etc/nixos
#   3. install-ida-mcp-plugin   # installs ida-pro-mcp + copies IDA plugin to ~/.idapro/plugins/
#   4. install-ida-plugins       # clones findcrypt-yara, LazyIDA, keypatch, FLARE, HexRaysCodeXplorer, patching
#   5. Start IDA, load a binary
#   6. ida-mcp-server            # starts MCP on http://127.0.0.1:13337/mcp
#   7. Claude Code MCP auto-configured in ~/.claude.json by install-ida-mcp-plugin:
#      "mcpServers": { "ida-pro-mcp": { "type": "http", "url": "http://127.0.0.1:13337/mcp" } }


Linux/IDA Pro 9.3 KeyGen.py
Linux/ida-pro_93_x64linux.run
Linux/hrtng-3.8.88.7z
Linux/kg_patch.rar
Linux/misc.rar
Linux/NixOS/packages/ida-pro.nix
Linux/NixOS/packages/ida-mcp.nix
Linux/NixOS/packages/ida-plugins.nix
